      "course_code": "ENVE",
      "course_num": "201",
      "course_combined": "ENVE 201",
      "title": "Earth Environ Sci",
      "catalog_entry_url": "https://ssb.iit.edu/bnrprd/bwckctlg.p_disp_course_detail?cat_term_in=202710&subj_code_in=ENVE&crse_numb_in=201",
      "course_description": "This course introduces students to the fundamentals of earth and environmental science. Topics include: earth systems science; geologic processes, soils, and minerals; global tectonics and earthquakes; environmental systems and biogeochemical cycles; land resources and agriculture; renewable and nonrenewable energy; water resources and water pollution; air pollution; solid waste; climate alteration and global climate change; and environmental sustainability.",
